{
  "key": "letter-051-part-06",
  "number": 51,
  "generationId": "01a1e4f1-e5bb-72d7-833d-fdd753d1c028",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Only that can be known.",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/51.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.1312929999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "And upon knowing that, immortality is also known.",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/52.mp3",
      "start": 2.308707,
      "end": 5.354444
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Life is eternal There is no beginning and no end to it.",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/53.mp3",
      "start": 6.419592,
      "end": 9.970362999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "It manifests, it unmanifests.",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/54.mp3",
      "start": 11.248957,
      "end": 13.765464999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "It moves from one form to another form.",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/55.mp3",
      "start": 14.957551,
      "end": 17.106077000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "In our ignorance, these transition points of change look like death.",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/56.mp3",
      "start": 18.279636999999997,
      "end": 21.595283000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "But for one who knows, death is nothing more than changing houses.",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/57.mp3",
      "start": 23.132018,
      "end": 27.606281000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Certainly there is rebirth;",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/58.mp3",
      "start": 29.132562,
      "end": 30.834717
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "but for me it is not a doctrine, it is an experience.",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/59.mp3",
      "start": 32.374036000000004,
      "end": 36.091429
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "And I don't want to make it a doctrine for others either.",
      "path": "audio/1968-51/60.mp3",
      "start": 37.698980000000006,
      "end": 40.91
    }
  ]
}
